h d=\"m10 1 2.2 6.8L19 10l-6.8 2.2L10 19l-2.2-6.8L1 10l6.8-2.2L10 1Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Made for the ride</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"wrap section\" id=\"lessons\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">Learn at your own pace</div>\n          <h2>Small steps.<br><em>Big moments.</em></h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>Our coaches make the first push feel easy\u2014and help you keep finding new things to love about skating.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lesson-grid\">\n        <article class=\"lesson-card\">\n          <div class=\"lesson-top\">\n            <span class=\"lesson-number\">01 / START HERE</span>\n            <span class=\"lesson-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 16c4.7 0 5.2-8 10-8 2.5 0 4 2 6 2M4 19c4.7 0 5.2-8 10-8 2.5 0 4 2 6 2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3>First push</h3>\n            <p>Find your balance, learn the basics, and get comfortable on a board. No experience needed.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"lesson-bottom\"><span>All ages \u00b7 60 min</span><a href=\"mailto:hello@kickturn.example\">Book now <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"lesson-card\">\n          <div class=\"lesson-top\">\n            <span class=\"lesson-number\">02 / FIND YOUR FEET</span>\n            <span class=\"lesson-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"m5 17 4-4 3 2 7-8M13 7h6v6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M4 20h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Build confidence</h3>\n            <p>Level up your turns, stopping, and cruising with a coach who meets you where you are.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"lesson-bottom\"><span>Small groups \u00b7 75 min</span><a href=\"mailto:hello@kickturn.example\">Book now <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"lesson-card\">\n          <div class=\"lesson-top\">\n            <span class=\"lesson-number\">03 / GO FOR IT</span>\n            <span class=\"lesson-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 17c4.5 0 4.5-10 9-10 2.5 0 3.5 3 7 3M4 20h16M9 8l2-4m5 2 3-3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Park sessions</h3>\n            <p>Get comfortable at the skatepark, work on new tricks, and skate with your people.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"lesson-bottom\"><span>Intermediate \u00b7 90 min</span><a href=\"mailto:hello@kickturn.example\">Book now <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"shop-section\" id=\"shop\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"eyebrow\">Good gear, no guesswork</div>\n            <h2>Meet your next<br><em>favorite board.</em></h2>\n          </div>\n          <p>We\u2019ll help you find the right setup, whether you\u2019